1. count(1..5) -> square -> main reads to the end
   main received:  [1 4 9 16 25]
   stages.Wait()   returned: count and square have ended
2. count(1..) -> square -> main reads 3, then cancels
   main received:  [1 4 9]
   stages.Wait()   returned: count and square have ended
   squares open:   false
